---
title: Hummus
portions: 4
category: Appetizer
source: "https://simple-veganista.com/homemade-hummus"
---

## Blend

[Blend] Place the @chickpeas{240 g}(drained), the @tahini{60 ml}, the @water{60 ml}, the @garlic{6 g}(crushed), the @lemon-juice{45 ml}, the @cumin{1 g} and a pinch of @salt{} in a #food processor{}. Blend until smooth and creamy, ~{2 min}. Scrape down the sides as needed.

[Adjust] Taste and adjust: more @lemon-juice{}, @salt{} or @water{30 ml} for a thinner consistency. Blend again briefly.

## Serve

[Serve] Spread in a shallow bowl and drizzle with @olive-oil{15 ml}. Top with a few @chickpeas{}, a sprinkle of @sesame-seeds{} or @paprika{}.
